tor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01WJuQRP2qz2jqFw9FEKWKJj", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55721, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01WJuQRP2qz2jqFw9FEKWKJj", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57107, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_018tBsah38far6rh1MRnpnb8", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57407, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_018tBsah38far6rh1MRnpnb8", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57407, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_018tBsah38far6rh1MRnpnb8", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 63927, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged the on-call engineer.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- **Bad release:** v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate. Its release candidate, v2.3.1-rc, was also marked unhealthy.\n- **Target:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production, so no approval was needed to go back to it.\n- **First attempt failed partway:** an orchestrator error stopped the rollback after us-east. For a short time us-east ran v2.3.0 while us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1.\n- **Second attempt finished:** I ran the rollback once more and it completed in all regions. The service now reports healthy with a 0.2% error rate.\n\n**Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback (including the halted first attempt) and the current state. The request to create it timed out. Because I'd sent it with a deduplication key, retrying wouldn't have created a copy, but I checked the incident list instead of retrying. It shows exactly one incident, INC-0001, and it's open.\n\n**Still to do:**\n- Find out what broke in v2.3.1.\n- Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012Sp7ZcqBQdxJzqutz3PgKW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01PZzv9BC1284xaCmhdAxd98", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01RBePD39eqYwKkqBXFVRG7X", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_015zusEVUeCrSFbvmBiPCaEk", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Rollback halted after us-east. Retrying once to complete the remaining regions.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01CfgszKCkK1wUQREQg6bWnh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_013padUHYuqb1DLjt9KxqYoZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-a