First attempt failed partway:** an orchestrator error stopped the rollback after us-east. For a short time us-east ran v2.3.0 while us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1.\n- **Second attempt finished:** I ran the rollback once more and it completed in all regions. The service now reports healthy with a 0.2% error rate.\n\n**Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback (including the halted first attempt) and the current state. The request to create it timed out. Because I'd sent it with a deduplication key, retrying wouldn't have created a copy, but I checked the incident list instead of retrying. It shows exactly one incident, INC-0001, and it's open.\n\n**Still to do:**\n- Find out what broke in v2.3.1.\n- Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}